  "ALL_TEXT": "129 INT. MINISTER'S HOUSE-DINGY ROOM - NIGHT \nThe FOREST MINISTER is giddy with excitement. He has the \nchombu with the idol water in his hands, the trio surrounded \nby his men. SUBBA RAJU also stands next to him, guarded by a \ncouple of goons. Everything is finally under the FOREST \nMINISTER's control, as he waits for the engraved manuscript. \nFOREST MINISTER \nVigraham meedaggare puttukoni enni \nnaatakaalu aadaru \nHe pulls out a gun \nFOREST MINISTER \nContainer ni ekkada daachaaru? \nLooking at SUBBA RAJU \nFOREST MINISTER \nVeellu nee deggara unnattu \nnaakenduku cheppaledhu... veellanu \nenduku vidipiyaalani chusaavu? \nSUBBA RAJU \nVaallu amaayakulu Sir. \nFOREST MINISTER \nAdi neeketla thelusu? \nSUBBA RAJU explains about the ANTHONY incident to the FOREST \nMINISTER \nFOREST MINISTER \nNaa yanaka naa vaallu intha \nnadipinchaara??... \nThe FOREST MINISTER turns to his PA. \nFOREST MINISTER \nChusaava PA... mana deggara pani \nchesthu mana manushule manalni etla \ndouble cross chesaaro... Plan kuda \nbhale vessaru kada... \nFOREST MINISTER \nmortuary nundi savaalu thechi, naa \ncar kalchi, andulo doubt raakunda \nmalli donga dabbu petti... ee \nthelivi naaku upayoga padetattu \nvaadi unte, ee roju vaallu \nbrathikunde vaallu nenu baagunde \nvaanni.... Ptch!... Em cheddam... \nKarma attuntadi! \nSUBBA RAJU \nVaallakemi theleedu dabbu \ngurinchi... vaalanodileyi. \nFOREST MINISTER \nNeekenduku antha chintha vaalla \ngurinchi? \nSUBBA RAJU \nPaapam Pillalu sir! \nThe FOREST MINISTER points to GOVARDHAN shaking in the chair. \nFOREST MINISTER \nEedu kuda pillode na? \nSUBBA RAJU is quiet. He thinks for a beat. The LEAD GOON \ncomes up to FOREST MINISTER and whispers in his ear \nLEAD GOON \nAnna baba \nkanapatledu..paaripoinattunnaadu... \nFOREST MINISTER \nInka vaadito naaku pani em ledu, \nvethiki champeyandi \nThe FOREST MINISTER furrows his brow, and yells out \nFOREST MINISTER \nEnta sepu aa thalapathraalu thisuko \nraavataaniki! Rei aa chombu naku \nethukura... \nGOVARDHAN \nAdi chombu kaadu kamalalam \nFOREST MINISTER \n(pissed) \nRei ah chombu..adey Kamalalam the \nThe ILLEGITIMATE SON goes to the Chombu and picks it up. He \nwalks up to SULOCHANA, stands next to her, and faces the \nFOREST MINISTER \nILLEGITIMATE SON \nNannu ippude bayata andari mundu \nnee kodukunani announce cheyyi ista \nFOREST MINISTER \nRei aasthi lo sagam raasista \nILLEGITIMATE SON \nNaaku vaddu...nenu adigindhi cheyyi \nFOREST MINISTER \nAdi ela kudurtundhi raa...jaragani \npani \nILLEGITIMATE SON \nSare aithe Sulochana idigo \nteesko...naa gift neeku. Idhi \nneedaggara unna varaku ayina \nmimalni emi cheyadu \nThe trio takes advantage of this, and leave with the BUM. The \nFOREST MINISTER is irate. He orders his goons to follow them \nfrom a distance. In order to pacify him, SUBBA RAJU has a \nthought. \nSUBBA RAJU \nNaaku 20% isthey Mee dabbu meeku \nthechistha, naannu ee okka \nraathiriki odilesthe... \nFOREST MINISTER \nDabbekkadundo thelusa? \nSUBBA RAJU \nANTHONY gadu city lone ekkado \ndhachadu... \nFOREST MINISTER \nMari patukokunda ikkadiki enthuku \nvochav \nSUBBA RAJU \n(sheepishly) \nSHAM GOPAL VERMA pilcharu drama ki. \nayina vadu ekkadiki paripothadu. \nMoyileni bharam ethadu. \nFOREST MINISTER \nInka evaru evariki thelusu \ndhinigurinchi \nSUBBA RAJU \nAa muggurike \nFOREST MINISTER \nhmmmm.. Sare.. \nCUT TO:",
